cff-version: 1.2.0
title: splitproof
message: "If you use splitproof to build, audit, or verify dataset splits in published work, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "O'Toole"
    given-names: Donncha
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/dnncha/splitproof
url: https://dnncha.github.io/splitproof/
abstract: >-
  splitproof builds, audits, and re-verifies leakage-free train/test splits for
  biological and chemical datasets. Users declare similarity, disjoint-group,
  and temporal constraints in a policy file; splitproof builds connected
  components into independent units, allocates them deterministically to folds,
  measures nearest-neighbour leakage diagnostics and a 1-NN similarity baseline,
  and emits a JSON certificate that anyone can recompute from scratch.
keywords:
  - data leakage
  - train-test split
  - biological machine learning
  - bioinformatics
  - cheminformatics
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
